{"strongs": "H7185", "word": "קָשָׁה", "translit": "qa.shah", "root": "קשא", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "be hard, severe, fierce", "definition": "I. [ קָשָׁה ] verb be hard, severe, fierce (Late Hebrew קָשָׁה be severe ; Arabic ( ) be hard, dry , III. endure, struggle against, severity ; Aramaic קְשָׁא , be hard, difficult ; Jewish-Aramaic קְשִׁי , קַשְׁיָה adjective hard ); — Qal Perfect 3 feminine singular קָֽשְׁתָה 1Sam 5:7 , קָשָׁ֑תָה Gen 49:7 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִקְשֶׁה Deut 1:17 ; Deut 15:18 , וַיִּ֫קֶשׁ 2Sam 19:44 — 1. be hard, difficult Deut 1:17 (of a legal case; מִן comparative). 2. be hard, severe , יָדוֺ ׳ ק עָלֵינוּ 1Sam 5:7 (of ׳ י , in judgement); בְעֵינֶ֑ךָ ׳ יִק . Deut 15:18 it shall not be hard in thine eyes (seem a severe trial, an injustice); of wrath Gen 49:7 (poem in J ; || עָ֑ז ); of fierce words 2Sam 19:44 . Niph`al Participle נִקְשֶׁה Isa 8:21 hardly bestead, hard pressed. Pi`el Imperfect 3 feminine singular וַתְּקַשׁ בְּלִדְתָּהּ Gen 35:16 ( E ) she made hard in her bearing (had severe labour). Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine singular הִקְשָׁה Exod 13:15 +, etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיֶּקֶשׁ 2Chr 36:13 3 masculine plural וַיַּקְשׁוּ Jer 7:26 +, etc.; Infinitive construct suffix בְּהַקְשֹׁתָהּ Gen 35:17 Participle מַקְשֶׁה Prov 28:14 ; Prov 29:1 — 1. make difficult, difficulty: הִקְשָׁה לְשַׁלְּחֵנוּ Exod 13:15 Pharaoh made difficulty about sending us away ; of travail Gen 35:17 ( E ; as Pi`el ); הִקְשִׁיתָ לִשְׁאוֺל 2Kgs 2:10 thou hast made hard to ask , asked a hard thing. 2. make severe, burdensome , yoke imposed by king 1Kgs 12:4 = 2Chr 10:4 . 3. a. make hard, stiff, stubborn , figurative of obstinacy: וַיַּקְשׁוּ אֶתעָֿרְפָּם 2Kgs 17:14 they stiffened their neck , so Jer 7:26 ; Jer 17:23 ; Jer 19:15 ; Deut 10:16 ; 2Chr 30:8 ; 2Chr 36:13 ; Neh 9:16 ; Neh 9:17 ; Neh 9:29 ; Prov 29:1 אַלתַּֿקְשׁוּ לְבַבְכֶם Ps 95:8 , compare Prov 28:14 subject ׳ י , ׳ אַקְשֶׁה אֶתלֵֿב פ Exod 7:3 ( P ), accusative אֶתרֿוחוֺ Deut 2:30 , \\ \\ b. shew stubborness Job 9:4 (with אֶל person [ ׳ י ]).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7635')\">BDB7635</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7185')\">H7185</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7634')\">BDB7634</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7636')\">BDB7636</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>קָשָׁה</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>be hard, severe, fierce</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <bdbheb>קָשָׁה</bdbheb> <highlight>be severe</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder4890/> (<placeholder4891/>) <highlight>be hard, dry</highlight>, III. <highlight>endure, struggle against, severity</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>קְשָׁא</bdbarc>, <placeholder4892/> <highlight>be hard, difficult</highlight>; Jewish-Aramaic <bdbarc>קְשִׁי</bdbarc>, <bdbheb>קַשְׁיָה</bdbheb> adjective <highlight>hard</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>קָֽשְׁתָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 5:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,5,7)\">1Sam 5:7</ref>, <bdbheb>קָשָׁ֑תָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,7)\">Gen 49:7</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִקְשֶׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,17)\">Deut 1:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 15:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,18)\">Deut 15:18</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּ֫קֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:44\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,44)\">2Sam 19:44</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>be hard, difficult</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,17)\">Deut 1:17</ref> (of a legal case; <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> comparative). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>be hard, severe</highlight>, <bdbheb>יָדוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>עָלֵינוּ</bdbheb><ref ref=\"1Sam 5:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,5,7)\">1Sam 5:7</ref> (of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>, in judgement); <bdbheb>בְעֵינֶ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יִק</bdbheb>. <ref ref=\"Deut 15:18\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,18)\">Deut 15:18</ref> <highlight>it shall not be hard in thine eyes</highlight> (seem a severe trial, an injustice); of wrath <ref ref=\"Gen 49:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,7)\">Gen 49:7</ref> (poem in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>עָ֑ז</bdbheb>); of fierce words <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:44\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,44)\">2Sam 19:44</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נִקְשֶׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,21)\">Isa 8:21</ref> <highlight>hardly bestead, hard pressed.</highlight> <b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>וַתְּקַשׁ בְּלִדְתָּהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,16)\">Gen 35:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) <highlight>she made hard in her bearing</highlight> (had severe labour). <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִקְשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 13:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,15)\">Exod 13:15</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיֶּקֶשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,13)\">2Chr 36:13</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>וַיַּקְשׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 7:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,7,26)\">Jer 7:26</ref> +, etc.; <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>בְּהַקְשֹׁתָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 35:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,17)\">Gen 35:17</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַקְשֶׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 28:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,14)\">Prov 28:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 29:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,1)\">Prov 29:1</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>make difficult, difficulty:</highlight> <bdbheb>הִקְשָׁה לְשַׁלְּחֵנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 13:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,15)\">Exod 13:15</ref> Pharaoh <highlight>made difficulty about sending us away</highlight>; of travail <ref ref=\"Gen 35:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,35,17)\">Gen 35:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; as <b>Pi`el</b>); <bdbheb>הִקְשִׁיתָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לִשְׁאוֺל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,10)\">2Kgs 2:10</ref> <highlight>thou hast made hard to ask</highlight>, asked a hard thing. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>make severe, burdensome</highlight>, yoke imposed by king <ref ref=\"1Kgs 12:4\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(11,12,4)\">1Kgs 12:4</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 10:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,10,4)\">2Chr 10:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3. a.</b> <highlight>make hard, stiff, stubborn</highlight>, figurative of obstinacy: